<</Columns 4/Predictor 12>>/Filter/FlateDecode/ID[<DEEA057AC39B54DA66825F4D68E14726><224E3A93548DCA43BB66CF103146436B>]/Index[7 2 420 1 1052 2]/Info 8 0 R/Length 31/Prev 2725965/Root 1 0 R/Size 1054/Type/XRef/W[1 3 0]>>stream
